---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Matias Caliz" description="Engineer, builder, and lifelong learner based in Buenos Aires.">
  <!-- Header -->
  <section class="pt-[var(--spacing-section)] pb-12">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-[var(--spacing-container)]">
      <p class="text-sm font-mono text-accent mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest hero-reveal" data-delay="0" data-i18n-es="Quién soy">Who I am</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4 hero-reveal" data-delay="100" data-i18n-es="Sobre mí">About</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary max-w-2xl leading-relaxed hero-reveal" data-delay="200" data-i18n-es="Ingeniero con background en seguridad, construyendo productos que resuelven problemas reales. Basado en Buenos Aires.">
        Engineer with a security background, building products that solve real problems. Based in Buenos Aires.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main content -->
  <section class="pb-[var(--spacing-section)]">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-[var(--spacing-container)]">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_320px] gap-16">
        <!-- Left: story -->
        <div class="space-y-12">
          <!-- Intro -->
          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed lang-en">
              I'm Matias — a 24-year-old Full Stack Engineer from Buenos Aires. I graduated as
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Ingeniero en Informatica</span> from UADE and currently work at
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Despegar</span>, where I build the search experience used by millions of travelers across Latin America.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed lang-es">
              Soy Matias — Ingeniero Full Stack de 24 años de Buenos Aires. Me recibí de
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Ingeniero en Informática</span> en UADE y actualmente trabajo en
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Despegar</span>, donde construyo la experiencia de búsqueda usada por millones de viajeros en Latinoamérica.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed lang-en">
              Before engineering, I worked as an
              <span class="text-text font-medium">IT Auditor at EY</span>, evaluating cybersecurity controls and system architecture for enterprise clients. That experience gave me something most developers don't have: a systematic understanding of how systems fail, how security breaks, and how to think about risk at an architectural level.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed lang-es">
              Antes de ingeniería, trabajé como
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Auditor de IT en EY</span>, evaluando controles de ciberseguridad y arquitectura de sistemas para grandes clientes. Esa experiencia me dio algo que la mayoría de los desarrolladores no tienen: un entendimiento sistemático de cómo fallan los sistemas, cómo se quiebra la seguridad y cómo pensar el riesgo a nivel arquitectónico.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed lang-en">
              Outside of work, I built two products independently:
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Finlatam</span>, a financial data dashboard for LATAM markets, and
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Gastronova</span>, a SaaS for restaurant management.
              I believe the best way to grow as an engineer is to own the full lifecycle — from idea to architecture to production.
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-text-secondary leading-relaxed lang-es">
              Fuera del trabajo, construí de forma independiente dos productos:
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Finlatam</span>, un dashboard de datos financieros para mercados LATAM, y
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Gastronova</span>, un SaaS para gestión gastronómica.
              Creo que la mejor forma de crecer como ingeniero es ser dueño de todo el ciclo — desde la idea a la arquitectura a producción.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Philosophy -->
          <div class="scroll-reveal border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <p class="text-base text-text italic leading-relaxed lang-en">
              "I think software engineering is at its best when it sits at the intersection of technical depth, product thinking, and real-world impact."
            </p>
            <p class="text-base text-text italic leading-relaxed lang-es">
              "Creo que la ingeniería de software está en su mejor momento cuando se encuentra en la intersección de profundidad técnica, pensamiento de producto e impacto real."
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- What drives me -->
          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-accent mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n-es="Qué me motiva">What drives me</h2>
            <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="p-5 border border-border rounded-xl hover:bg-bg-secondary hover:border-border-hover transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="text-lg mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75L22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3l-4.5 16.5" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1" data-i18n-es="Oficio">Craftsmanship</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed" data-i18n-es="Escribir código que no solo funcione, sino que esté bien arquitecturado, sea performante y mantenible.">
                  Writing code that's not just functional, but well-architected, performant, and maintainable.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-border rounded-xl hover:bg-bg-secondary hover:border-border-hover transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="text-lg mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1" data-i18n-es="Seguridad">Security</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed" data-i18n-es="Mi background en auditoría hace que la seguridad no sea un afterthought — está integrada en cómo diseño sistemas.">
                  My audit background means security isn't an afterthought — it's baked into how I design systems.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-border rounded-xl hover:bg-bg-secondary hover:border-border-hover transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="text-lg mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 3v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 16.5h2.25M3.75 3h-1.5m1.5 0h16.5m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 16.5h-2.25m-7.5 0h7.5m-7.5 0l-1 3m8.5-3l1 3m0 0l.5 1.5m-.5-1.5h-9.5m0 0l-.5 1.5M9 11.25v1.5M12 9v3.75m3-6v6" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1" data-i18n-es="Impacto">Impact</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed" data-i18n-es="Quiero construir cosas que la gente realmente use. Millones de usuarios interactúan con mi código todos los días.">
                  I want to build things that people actually use. Millions of users interact with my code every day.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="p-5 border border-border rounded-xl hover:bg-bg-secondary hover:border-border-hover transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="text-lg mb-2">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.59 14.37a6 6 0 01-5.84 7.38v-4.8m5.84-2.58a14.98 14.98 0 006.16-12.12A14.98 14.98 0 009.631 8.41m5.96 5.96a14.926 14.926 0 01-5.841 2.58m-.119-8.54a6 6 0 00-7.381 5.84h4.8m2.58-5.84a14.927 14.927 0 00-2.58 5.84m2.699 2.7c-.103.021-.207.041-.311.06a15.09 15.09 0 01-2.448-2.448 14.9 14.9 0 01.06-.312m-2.24 2.39a4.493 4.493 0 00-1.757 4.306 4.493 4.493 0 004.306-1.758M16.5 9a1.5 1.5 0 11-3 0 1.5 1.5 0 013 0z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-1">Ownership</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-text-secondary leading-relaxed" data-i18n-es="Construir side projects end-to-end — del concepto a la arquitectura al deploy — porque ahí es donde pasa el crecimiento real.">
                  Building side projects end-to-end — from concept to architecture to deployment — because that's where real growth happens.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: sidebar -->
        <aside class="space-y-8 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start">
          <!-- Quick facts -->
          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-mono text-text-tertiary mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n-es="Datos rápidos">Quick facts</h3>
            <dl class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline py-2 border-b border-border">
                <dt class="text-sm text-text-secondary" data-i18n-es="Ubicación">Location</dt>
                <dd class="text-sm font-medium">Buenos Aires</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline py-2 border-b border-border">
                <dt class="text-sm text-text-secondary" data-i18n-es="Rol">Role</dt>
                <dd class="text-sm font-medium">Full Stack Dev</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline py-2 border-b border-border">
                <dt class="text-sm text-text-secondary" data-i18n-es="Empresa">Company</dt>
                <dd class="text-sm font-medium">Despegar</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline py-2 border-b border-border">
                <dt class="text-sm text-text-secondary" data-i18n-es="Educación">Education</dt>
                <dd class="text-sm font-medium">Ing. Informatica</dd>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline py-2 border-b border-border">
                <dt class="text-sm text-text-secondary" data-i18n-es="Idiomas">Languages</dt>
                <dd class="text-sm font-medium">ES / EN (B2)</dd>
              </div>
            </dl>
          </div>

          <!-- Interests -->
          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-mono text-text-tertiary mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n-es="Intereses">Interests</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
              {[
                "Fintech",
                "Data Analysis",
                "Cybersecurity",
                "Biohacking",
                "Real Estate",
                "Geopolitics",
                "Entrepreneurship",
              ].map((interest) => (
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-text-secondary bg-bg-secondary rounded-lg border border-border">
                  {interest}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Daily stack -->
          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-mono text-text-tertiary mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n-es="Stack diario">Daily stack</h3>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              {[
                { label: "Frontend", tools: "React, Angular, TypeScript" },
                { label: "Backend", tools: "Java, Spring, Node.js" },
                { label: "Data", tools: "SQL, Python, MongoDB" },
                { label: "Testing", tools: "Cypress, Jest, JUnit" },
                { label: "Infra", tools: "Docker, Linux, Git" },
              ].map((row) => (
                <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 py-1.5">
                  <span class="text-xs font-mono text-accent w-20 shrink-0">{row.label}</span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-text-secondary">{row.tools}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Connect -->
          <div class="scroll-reveal">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-mono text-text-tertiary mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest" data-i18n-es="Contacto">Connect</h3>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/mati-caliz"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 group"
              >
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="group-hover:underline underline-offset-4">GitHub</span>
              </a>
              <a
                href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/matias-caliz/"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 group"
              >
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433c-1.144 0-2.063-.926-2.063-2.065 0-1.138.92-2.063 2.063-2.063 1.14 0 2.064.925 2.064 2.063 0 1.139-.925 2.065-2.064 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="group-hover:underline underline-offset-4">LinkedIn</span>
              </a>
              <a
                href="mailto:matiascaliz@hotmail.com"
                class="flex items-center gap-2.5 py-2 text-sm text-text-secondary hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200 group"
              >
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75"></path>
                </svg>
                <span class="group-hover:underline underline-offset-4">matiascaliz@hotmail.com</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
